    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d48">

                <pb facs="0078" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg44"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">November 5,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Brazilian soldier attempted to assassinate the President to day. Minister of war,
                    defending him, was killed. Great excitement, but not general alarm.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
